  "description": "Ink Rush is a bold and expressive dripping layered graffiti font crafted to bring an intense, street-inspired energy to any project. This font offers five distinct styles—solid, dripping solid, outlined, extruded, and dripping extruded—each providing unique looks for a variety of design needs. The solid styles offer clean, bold letterforms, while the dripping variations add an edgy, liquid effect that mimics fresh spray paint in motion.\n The outlined and extruded styles introduce depth and a sense of layering, allowing you to build rich, impactful designs. With its combination of gritty urban appeal and versatile layering options, Ink Rush is perfect for posters, streetwear, album covers, graffiti-inspired branding, and any project looking to capture the raw, energetic spirit of street art. This font delivers an authentic, rebellious vibe that stands out and grabs attention.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Ink Rush is a bold and expressive dripping layered graffiti font crafted to bring an intense, street-inspired energy to any project. This font offers five distinct styles—solid, dripping solid, outlined, extruded, and dripping extruded—each providing unique looks for a variety of design needs. The solid styles offer clean, bold letterforms, while the dripping variations add an edgy, liquid effect that mimics fresh spray paint in motion.</p>\n<p> The outlined and extruded styles introduce depth and a sense of layering, allowing you to build rich, impactful designs. With its combination of gritty urban appeal and versatile layering options, Ink Rush is perfect for posters, streetwear, album covers, graffiti-inspired branding, and any project looking to capture the raw, energetic spirit of street art. This font delivers an authentic, rebellious vibe that stands out and grabs attention.</p>",
